          RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"i", "++"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"(*", 
         RowBox[{"For", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"i", "=", "1"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"i", "<=", 
            RowBox[{"Length", "@", "singularIndexes"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"i", "++"}], ","}]}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"testSingularIndex", "=", 
          RowBox[{"singularIndexes", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"testSingularPoint", "=", 
          RowBox[{"theSingularList", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "testSingularIndex", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{"$checkColinearPointsFlag", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<Testing singular point \>\"", ",", 
              RowBox[{"testSingularPoint", "//", "N"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]}], 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"testRadius", "=", 
          RowBox[{"minRadiusArray", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "testSingularIndex", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"testBaseNDZ", ",", "testNextNDZ", ",", "testNextNDZ2"}], 
           "}"}], "=", 
          RowBox[{"getIntegrationData", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "baseSingularPoint", ",", "baseRadius", ",", "nextSing", ",", 
            "nextRadius"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"theT", "=", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"testSingularPoint", "-", "baseNDZ"}], ")"}], "/", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"nextNDZ", "-", "baseNDZ"}], ")"}]}]}], ";", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"tAcc", "=", 
          RowBox[{"Floor", "@", 
           RowBox[{"Accuracy", "@", "theT"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{"$checkColinearPointsFlag", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<Accuracy of theT: \>\"", ",", 
              RowBox[{"Accuracy", "@", "theT"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
            RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<theT: \>\"", ",", 
              RowBox[{"theT", "//", "N"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]}], 
          "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
              RowBox[{"Im", "[", "theT", "]"}], "]"}], "<", 
             RowBox[{"10", "^", 
              RowBox[{"-", 
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"tAcc", "-", "10"}], ")"}]}]}]}], " ", "&&", " ", 
            RowBox[{"0", "<", 
             RowBox[{"Re", "[", "theT", "]"}], "<", "1"}]}], ",", 
           "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"If", "[", 
             RowBox[{"$checkColinearPointsFlag", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"\"\<Singular index \>\"", ",", "Blue"}], "]"}], 
                 ",", 
                 RowBox[{
                 "testSingularIndex", "  ", 
                  "\"\<, is co-linear with integration path!\>\""}]}], "]"}], 
               ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"\"\<theT: \>\"", ",", "Red", ",", "14"}], "]"}], 
                 ",", 
                 RowBox[{"theT", "//", "N"}], ",", "\"\< is in domain\>\""}], 
                "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"\"\<     testIndex: \>\"", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"Darker", "@", "Green"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
                 "testSingularIndex"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<     testSing: \>\"", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"testSingularPoint", "//", "N"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
               "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
                RowBox[{"\"\<     removableList: \>\"", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"nextRemovableList", "//", "N"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]}], 
             "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
            RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
             RowBox[{"removableTable", ",", "testSingularIndex"}], "]"}], 
            ";"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";"}]}], 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{"$checkColinearPointsFlag", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<colinear table: \>\"", ",", 
           RowBox[{"removableTable", "//", "N"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
         RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Exiting checkColinearPoints\>\"", ",", "Red"}], "]"}],
           "]"}], ";"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", "removableTable"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}]}]], "Input",
